SUMMARY:Twilight Wishes
DESCRIPTION:Event\nCelebrate Twilight Wishes with costumed Espeon and Umbre
 on\, increased Shiny chances for Staryu and Elgyem\, and event GO Pass rew
 ards and bonuses!\nFeatured Pokémon: Espeon wearing a sun scarf\, Umbreon
  wearing a moon scarf\, Rockruff\nSpawns: Clefairy\, Jigglypuff\, Staryu\,
  Chimecho\, Munna\, Elgyem\, Rockruff\nOne-Star Raids: Sun Crown Pikachu 
 ✨\, Moon Crown Pikachu ✨\nThree-Star Raids: Day Scarf Espeon ✨\, Nig
 ht Scarf Umbreon ✨\nFive-Star Raids: Cresselia ✨\, Darkrai ✨\, Deoxy
 s (Normal) ✨\, Deoxys (Defense) ✨\, Deoxys (Attack) ✨\, Deoxys (Spee
 d) ✨\nMega Raids: Mega Beedrill ✨\, Mega Houndoom ✨\, Mega Sableye 
 ✨\, Mega Manectric ✨\nNovember 24 at 10:00 a.m. to November 26 at 10:0
 0 a.m. local time: Catch 10 Pokémon ✨\, Explore 1 km ✨\, Hatch an Egg
 REWARDMaschiff\, Mega Evolve a Pokémon\nNovember 26 at 10:00 a.m. to Nove
 mber 30 at 8:00 p.m. local time: Catch 10 Pokémon ✨\, Explore 1 km ✨\
 , Mega Evolve a Pokémon\, ???REWARDSpooky Festival Gengar ✨\, ???REWARD
 Halloween Drifblim ✨\, ???REWARDBramblin\nIncreased Shiny Chances: Stary
 u\, Starmie\, Elgyem\, Beheeyem\nBonuses: Increased chance to encounter Sh
 iny Staryu and Shiny Elgyem\nDetails: https://leekduck.com/events/twilight
 -wishes-2026/
